msgid ""
"Actions address material workforce impacts such as labor conditions,\n"
"                                diversity,\n"
"                                inclusion, health &amp; safety, training, "
"and social dialogue.\n"
"                                Resources are\n"
"                                allocated to mitigate risks, enhance "
"positive impacts, and implement\n"
"                                workforce-related programs. Actions are "
"prioritized based on\n"
"                                severity and likelihood\n"
"                                of impacts, following a mitigation "
"hierarchy: prevent, reduce,\n"
"                                remediate, promote\n"
"                                positive opportunities. Engagement with "
"workers and representatives\n"
"                                informs the\n"
"                                planning and execution of actions."
msgstr ""
"Ukrepi obravnavajo pomembne vplive na delovno silo, kot so delovni pogoji,\n"
"                                raznolikost,\n"
"                                vključevanje, zdravje &amp; varnost, "
"usposabljanje in socialni dialog.\n"
"                                Sredstva se\n"
"                                namenjajo zmanjševanju tveganj, krepitvi "
"pozitivnih vplivov in izvajanju\n"
"                                programov, povezanih z delovno silo. Ukrepi "
"imajo prednost glede na\n"
"                                resnost in verjetnost\n"
"                                vplivov v skladu s hierarhijo blaženja: "
"preprečiti, zmanjšati,\n"
"                                odpraviti, spodbujati\n"
"                                pozitivne priložnosti. Vključevanje delavcev "
"in njihovih predstavnikov\n"
"                                usmerja\n"
"                                načrtovanje in izvajanje ukrepov."

